Apply database schema migrations from the backend directory before starting
the application or running the seed/data-generation scripts:

    alembic upgrade head

Warning: the current initial revision assumes tables already exist and fails
on a fresh database. Do not run it against an existing database without first
backing up the database and verifying its schema and migration state. A proper
baseline migration is still needed.

The application and scripts do not create tables automatically. Use Alembic
to manage schema changes; generate a revision with:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"